{
    "title": "Lama Ludo-Ludo&Chatroom",
    "description": "Lama Ludo is a Party Games APP that young people love to play. It not only has Ludo game in various modes, but also offers the most popular party games and online voice chat. You will have more fun while playing games and make friends at the same time!\r\n\r\n[Various party games]\r\nLama Ludo has the following games:\r\n1. Ludo Game: A Globally popular board game, Various Ludo Mode for you to choice in Lama ludo!\r\n2. Brain Storm: A Quiz games, 1v1competition to see who can answer correctly and faster.\r\n3. Guess Their Answers: A Quiz games, 4 players grab the chance to answer and speak the guessed answer.\r\n4. UMO: A popular card game, that has four color card where players can lay cards which match the same color or number.\r\n5. Carrom: A tabletop game of Indian origin in which players flick discs, attempting to knock them to the corners of the board.\r\n6. Who's the spy: A classic game in variety shows. Describe the word without the spy noticing, come and battle against your friends!\r\n\r\n[Chat in Voice room]\r\nIt is so convenient for all users find your Ludo friends and discuss your ludo matters in Lama Ludo exclusive voice chat room! 24 hours available, anytime , anywhere!\r\n\r\n\u2764[LIKE US and CONNECTED US]\u2764\r\nDear Lama Ludo users, your feedback and suggestions are welcomed to: ludo.courage@gmail.com",
